ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "The principal aim of Q-MEGA is to provide a large and well-described population-based sample of CMM cases and their families, with blood collection for genetic purposes and detailed information on sun exposure and phenotype to explore the effect that environmental and genetic factors, and their interaction, play in the etiology of CMM.") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3677021/") Annotation(obo:IAO_0000116 "sun exposure") ObjectSomeValuesFrom(coho:is_designed_to_study_exposure obo:ECTO_8000061) coho:COHO_0001031)
