ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "A national registry–based case–control study [ESCALE (Etude Sur les Cancers et les Leucémies de l’Enfant, Study on Environmental and Genetic Risk Factors of Childhood Cancers and Leukemia)] carried out in France was used to assess the effect of exposure to road traffic exhaust fumes on the risk of childhood leukemia.") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3080942/fullTextXML") Annotation(obo:IAO_0000116 "road traffic exhaust fumes") ObjectSomeValuesFrom(coho:is_designed_to_study_exposure obo:ECTO_7000156) coho:COHO_0001707)
