ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "The objectives of the Southampton Women’s Survey are: a)to characterise the influence of the mother’s own fetal growth and of her diet, body composition and endocrine profile before and during pregnancy on: 1) the early trajectory of fetal growth; 2) the maintenance of this growth trajectory in late gestation;") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4579566/") Annotation(obo:IAO_0000116 "mother's diet before and during pregnancy") ObjectSomeValuesFrom(coho:is_designed_to_study_exposure obo:ECTO_6000021) coho:COHO_0002427)
